---
description: Rules for the React web app
globs: apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` rules 10, 11, 14 and 23, and `docs/13`.

- The web app calls only the CanDo API. Use `supabase-js` for sign-in and session handling only, never for data.
- Every user-facing string lives in `en-CA` and `fr-CA` resource files. Dates, numbers and currency use the user's locale (`1 234,56 $` in French).
- Every screen works by keyboard and screen reader (WCAG 2.1 AA), including the org chart's "Move to…" alternative to drag and drop.
- Every screen honours the as-of date control.
- Never show data the API did not return for this user. Live-update messages only trigger a refetch.
- Use the Lovable demo's layouts as the visual reference.
